  "content": "<p>NexGen Energy Ltd. is a Canadian-based corporation focused on the acquisition, exploration, and development of uranium projects in the Athabasca Basin of Saskatchewan, Canada. The company's primary asset is the Rook I Project, which hosts the high-grade Arrow Deposit, one of the largest undeveloped uranium resources in the world. NexGen is committed to developing the project with a focus on environmental sustainability and social responsibility, aiming to become a leading supplier of clean energy fuel to the global nuclear power industry.</p>\n",
  "tabs": [
    {
      "label": "Management",
      "content": "<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 24px;\">Officers</h2><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Leigh%20Curyer\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Leigh Curyer</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(Date: 2011 December)</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Chief Executive Officer</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Curyer has over 20 years of experience in the resources sector. He was previously the Chief Financial Officer and head of corporate development of First Uranium Corporation and has held senior positions at Accord Nuclear Resource Management and Deloitte & Touche.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Benjamin%20P.S.%20Salter\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Benjamin P.S. Salter</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(Date: 2023 January)</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Chief Financial Officer</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Salter is a Chartered Professional Accountant with over 15 years of experience in financial reporting and corporate finance. He previously served as the Vice President, Finance of the Company.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Travis%20McPherson\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Travis McPherson</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(Date: 2022 January)</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Chief Commercial Officer</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. McPherson has been with NexGen since 2014. He has over 10 years of experience in the uranium industry and was previously with a boutique investment bank.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Gillian%20Morris\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Gillian Morris</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(Date: 2021 January)</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Vice President, Corporate and People</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Ms. Morris has over 20 years of experience in human resources and corporate operations. She previously held senior HR roles at various mining and resource companies.</p></div><h2 style=\"margin-top: 40px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">Directors</h2><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Christopher%20McFadden\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Christopher McFadden</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(Date: 2013 January)</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Chairman</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. McFadden is a lawyer with over 20 years of experience in the resources sector. He was previously the Chairman of NexGen and has held senior roles at Rio Tinto.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Leigh%20Curyer\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Leigh Curyer</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(Date: 2011 December)</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Founder of NexGen Energy Ltd. with extensive experience in uranium project development and corporate finance.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Richard%20Paton\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Richard Paton</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(Date: 2014 January)</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Paton has over 30 years of experience in public policy and government relations. He was the President and CEO of the Chemistry Industry Association of Canada.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Trevor%20Thiele\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Trevor Thiele</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(Date: 2013 January)</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Thiele has over 30 years of experience in senior financial roles. He was the CFO of several major Australian resource companies.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Warren%20Gilman\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Warren Gilman</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(Date: 2017 January)</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Gilman is the Chairman and CEO of Queen's Road Capital Investment Ltd. and has over 30 years of experience as a mining engineer and investment banker.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Brad%20Wall\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Brad Wall</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(Date: 2019 January)</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Wall served as the 14th Premier of Saskatchewan from 2007 to 2018. He has extensive experience in economic development and the energy sector.</p></div><h2 style=\"margin-top: 40px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sources</h2><ul style=\"padding-left: 20px; line-height: 1.6;\"><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; color: #333;\"><a href=\"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1698535/000119312524115423/d784568d6k.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #0066cc; text-decoration: none;\">Form 6-K - Management Information Circular</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(As of: 2024-04-24)</span></li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; color: #333;\"><a href=\"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1698535/000119312524061542/d712345d40f.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #0066cc; text-decoration: none;\">Form 40-F - Annual Report</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(As of: 2024-03-07)</span></li></ul>"
    }
